  "sourceTitle": "Zucchini Cookies",
  "sourceText": "Zucchini Cookies\nBy: Victoria\nPublished: Sunday, December 6, 2009 - 12:33am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 1/2 cups GRATED ZUCCHINI\n1 1/2 cups SUGAR\n1/2 cup BUTTER\n1 teaspoon VANILLA\n3 1/2 cups FLOUR\n2 teaspoons BAKING POWDER\n2 teaspoons SODA\n1/2 teaspoon SALT\n1 cup CHOCOLATE CHIPS\n1 cup CHOPPED NUTS\n\nPreparation\n\n1 COMBINE ALL INGREDIENTS IN A LARGE BOWL AND DROP BY SPOONFULS ON A BAKING SHEET. BAKE AT 350 DEG F. FOR 12 TO 13 MINUTES.",
